<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 02:05:18 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>《GTA 6》正在悄悄打造有史以来最疯狂的视频游戏原声带之一</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-is-quietly-building-one-of-the-most-insane-video-game-soundtracks-ever/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乡村歌手摩根·沃伦 (Morgan Wallen) 透露将与《侠盗猎车手 6》进行合作，显然会出现在游戏的配乐和/或游戏内广播电台中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-is-quietly-building-one-of-the-most-insane-video-game-soundtracks-ever/"&gt;《GTA 6》正在悄然打造有史以来最疯狂的视频游戏原声带之一，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 22:48:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-is-quietly-building-one-of-the-most-insane-video-game-soundtracks-ever/</guid></item><item><title>Lady Gaga 在赢得 1 亿美元“混乱”诉讼后发起反击，要求冲浪品牌赔偿</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/lady-gaga-fires-back-after-winning-100-million-mayhem-lawsuit-demands-surf-brand-pay-up/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Lady Gaga 赢得了围绕 2025 年专辑《Mayhem》标题的诉讼，现在希望起诉她的公司支付她的法律费用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/lady-gaga-fires-back-after-winning-100-million-mayhem-lawsuit-demands-surf-brand-pay-up/"&gt;Lady Gaga 在赢得 1 亿美元“混乱”诉讼后发起反击，要求冲浪品牌赔付&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 20:36:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/lady-gaga-fires-back-after-winning-100-million-mayhem-lawsuit-demands-surf-brand-pay-up/</guid></item><item><title>里尔·杜克 (Lil Durk) 在等待敲诈勒索审判时向孩子们提供了重要建议：“成长是真实的”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/lil-durk-gives-crucial-advice-to-children-as-he-awaits-racketeering-trial-growth-is-real/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;里尔·杜克 (Lil Durk) 在等待下一次法庭审判开始时，向年轻一代分享了一条温馨的信息和建议。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/lil-durk-gives-crucial-advice-to-children-as-he-awaits-racketeering-trial-growth-is-real/"&gt;《Lil Durk 在等待敲诈勒索审判时向孩子们提供重要建议：“成长是真实的”》&lt;/a&gt;一文首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:48:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/lil-durk-gives-crucial-advice-to-children-as-he-awaits-racketeering-trial-growth-is-real/</guid></item><item><title>奥斯卡奖得主揭晓纽约消防员和司仪的地下说唱经典，这为他的最新电影提供了灵感</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/oscar-winner-reveals-the-underground-rap-classic-by-nyc-firefighter-and-emcee-that-inspired-his-latest-film/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;奥斯卡奖获奖演员马赫沙拉·阿里透露了启发他最新角色的地下嘻哈传奇人物。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这位&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/oscar-winner-reveals-the-underground-rap-classic-by-nyc-firefighter-and-emcee-that-inspired-his-latest-film/"&gt;奥斯卡奖获得者揭晓了纽约消防员和司仪的地下说唱经典，这为他的最新电影提供了灵感&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:49:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/oscar-winner-reveals-the-underground-rap-classic-by-nyc-firefighter-and-emcee-that-inspired-his-latest-film/</guid></item><item><title>纽约传奇硬核朋克乐队不确定是否会在没有已故主唱的情况下继续下去，尽管这是他想要的</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/legendary-nyc-hardcore-punk-band-isnt-sure-about-continuing-without-their-late-frontman-even-though-its-what-he-wanted/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《Sick of It All》乐队的皮特·科勒 (Pete Koller) 表示，他已故的兄弟 Lou 希望乐队在他去世后继续前进，但他们不确定自己的感受。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/legendary-nyc-hardcore-punk-band-isnt-sure-about-continuing-without-their-late-frontman-even-though-its-what-he-wanted/"&gt;传奇纽约硬核朋克乐队不确定是否会在没有已故主唱的情况下继续下去，尽管这是他想要的&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:44:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/legendary-nyc-hardcore-punk-band-isnt-sure-about-continuing-without-their-late-frontman-even-though-its-what-he-wanted/</guid></item><item><title>我们劫持了果蝇的大脑并让它写下 VICE 头条新闻</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/we-hijacked-a-fruit-flys-brain-and-got-it-to-come-up-with-vice-stories/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;上周末，X 上的用户开始尝试由人工智能绘制的果蝇大脑模拟。 Vivi 编码员一直在为果蝇神经网络的在线复制提供一系列要执行的任务，包括交易加密货币（它获得了 [...]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/we-hijacked-a-fruit-flys-brain-and-got-it-to-come-up-with-vice-stories/"&gt;我们劫持了果蝇的大脑并让它写成 VICE 头条新闻的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:12:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/we-hijacked-a-fruit-flys-brain-and-got-it-to-come-up-with-vice-stories/</guid></item><item><title>Next Xbox 游戏通行证波包括两个巨大的第一天游戏</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/next-xbox-game-pass-wave-includes-two-huge-day-one-titles/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Xbox Game Pass Ultimate 和 PC 订阅者可以在 9 月底和 10 月初访问两款主要的 Day One 游戏。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/next-xbox-game-pass-wave-includes-two-huge-day-one-titles/"&gt;Next Xbox Game Pass Wave 包括两个巨大的第一天游戏&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:26:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/next-xbox-game-pass-wave-includes-two-huge-day-one-titles/</guid></item><item><title>GTA 6 广播艺术家揭晓——Travis Scott、Morgan Wallen 等</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-radio-artists-travis-scott-morgan-wallen/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Rockstar Games 已允许几位主要艺术家透露他们将出现在 GTA 6 中。从 Travis Scott 到 Morgan Wallen，以下是今天宣布的所有 Grand Theft Auto VI 无线电艺术家。目前已确认 GTA 6 广播艺术家虽然 GTA 6 Extended Look 在多个场景中加入了音乐，但 Rockstar Games [...]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-radio-artists-travis-scott-morgan-wallen/"&gt;《侠盗猎车手 6》之后的广播艺术家揭晓——特拉维斯·斯科特、摩根·沃伦等人&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:25:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-radio-artists-travis-scott-morgan-wallen/</guid></item><item><title>2000 年代初另类摇滚英雄因歌手紧急眼科手术而被迫取消巡演日期</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/early-2000s-alt-rock-heroes-forced-to-cancel-tour-dates-due-to-singers-emergency-eye-surgery/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;由于主唱吉姆·阿德金斯（Jim Adkins）正在从眼部手术中恢复，吉米美食世界（Jimmy Eat World）被迫取消了剩余的九月巡演日​​期。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/early-2000s-alt-rock-heroes-forced-to-cancel-tour-dates-due-to-singers-emergency-eye-surgery/"&gt;2000 年代早期另类摇滚英雄因歌手紧急眼科手术而被迫取消巡演日期的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:08:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/early-2000s-alt-rock-heroes-forced-to-cancel-tour-dates-due-to-singers-emergency-eye-surgery/</guid></item><item><title>怀旧的千禧一代将捍卫 3 首“俗气”的 Y2K 流行歌曲</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-cheesy-y2k-pop-hits-that-nostalgic-millennials-will-defend-with-honor/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;许多在新千年长大的千禧一代现在都怀念它。回顾过去，2000 年代初期很奇怪，因为我们追求更加未来主义的美学。我们以为即将到来的未来尚未到来，但我们仍然怀念那个时代。在世纪之交，泡泡糖流行起来，男孩 […]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-cheesy-y2k-pop-hits-that-nostalgic-millennials-will-defend-with-honor/"&gt;怀旧的千禧一代将捍卫荣誉的第三首“俗气”Y2K 流行歌曲&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:03:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-cheesy-y2k-pop-hits-that-nostalgic-millennials-will-defend-with-honor/</guid></item></channel></rss>